{"id": "1791490", "name": "גבול סדרה מהצורה (1+1/(cⁿ+a))^(b·cⁿ) – תת-סדרה של e", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>חשבו את גבול הסדרה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle a_n=\\left(1+\\frac{1}{{{CT:0}}^n+{{CT:1}}}\\right)^{{{CT:2}}\\cdot{{CT:0}}^n} \\]</p><p>שימוש בגבול המגדיר את הקבוע <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle e\\)</span></p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle \\lim_{n\\to\\infty}a_n=\\)\n[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">כתיבה בצורה של הגבול המופלא</b><br><p>נסמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle m_n={{CT:0}}^n+{{CT:1}}\\)</span>. אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle m_n\\to\\infty\\)</span>, וגם</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle \\frac{{{CT:2}}\\,{{CT:0}}^n}{m_n}\\longrightarrow {{CT:2}} \\]</p><p>נכתוב</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle a_n=[\\left(1+\\frac{1}{m_n}\\right)^{m_n}]^{\\frac{{{CT:2}}\\cdot {{CT:0}}^n}{m_n}} \\]</p><p>הביטוי שבסוגריים שואף ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle e\\)</span>, והמעריך שואף ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:2}}\\)</span>. לכן</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle \\lim_{n\\to\\infty}a_n=e^{{CT:2}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\">[[feedback:Result]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "[[BASIC-CALCULUS]]", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "theLimit", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">נכון. הגבול הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle e^{{CT:2}}\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">התשובה אינה נכונה. נסו לכתוב את הביטוי בעזרת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle \\left(1+\\frac1m\\right)^m\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["aa", "bb", "cc", "theLimit"], "nvariants": 48}